### Recuperar todas las peliculas

GET http://localhost:1234/movies

### Recuperar una pelicula por id

GET http://localhost:1234/movies/7df43fe4-5471-4fd2-b28b-2e5de5df8672

### Recuperar todas la peliculas por un genero
GET http://localhost:1234/movies?genre=ACTION&DRAMA

### Crear una pelicula con POST
POST http://localhost:1234/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "The Odissey",
    "year": 2026,
    "director": "Christopher Nolan",
    "duration": 150,
    "rate": 9.2,
    "poster": "https://imagenes.hobbyconsolas.com/files/image_640_auto/uploads/imagenes/2026/06/07/6a253ddfdf31c7-14120652.jpeg",
    "genre": [
        "Action",
        "Drama",
        "Adventure"
    ]
}

### Crear segunda pelicula con POST
POST http://localhost:1234/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Oppenheimer",
    "year": 2023,
    "director": "Christopher Nolan",
    "duration": 180,
    "rate": 9.5,
    "poster": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xDtUSyAKL._AC_UF894,1000_QL80_.jpg",
    "genre": [
        "Action",
        "Drama",
        "Adventure"
    ]   
}

### Actualizar una película
PATCH http://localhost:1234/movies/7df43fe4-5471-4fd2-b28b-2e5de5df8672
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2027
}

### Intento de desarrollo TRACE
TRACE http://localhost:1234/


